Materials/01 Collect attachments into the note's folder/
Materials/_shared-attachments/
consistency-report.md

# Created by the buttons in `08 Keep paths valid on every platform.md`. Deliberately not committed: the
# Fixture's whole point is a 300-byte file name, which is the kind of name a checkout should not have to
# Carry.
Materials/08 Keep paths valid on every platform/
